sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant App as Web app
  participant Auth as Auth service
  participant DB as Database
  User->>App: Sign in with email
  App->>+Auth: POST /token
  Auth->>DB: Look up user
  DB-->>Auth: User record
  alt password matches
    Auth-->>App: Access token
    App-->>User: Welcome back
  else wrong password
    Auth-->>-App: 401 Unauthorized
    App-->>User: Try again
  end
  Note over App,Auth: Tokens expire after 15 minutes
  loop every 14 minutes
    App->>Auth: Refresh token
  end
